},
{
"text": "MUSCULOSKELETAL IMAGING",
"rect": [
94.6103876287287,
763.7629870129871,
198.42531773951148,
772.7564974698154
],
"fontSize": 8.99351045682829
},
{
"text": "L",
"rect": [
65.89285119787439,
271.0682164972479,
79.93506394423447,
294.39613560267856
],
"fontSize": 23.32791910543068
},
{
"text": "umbar disk herniation is a frequent degenerative disor-",
"rect": [
74.38311886477781,
286.1980638380174,
285.0000059449828,
296.1980598746956
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678226
},
{
"text": "der, commonly causing lower back pain and entailing",
"rect": [
74.38311886477781,
274.2337860503754,
285.0162357478947,
284.2337820870536
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678226
},
{
"text": "substantial social and economic burden (1–3). Compli-",
"rect": [
65.89285119787439,
262.2695082627334,
284.98376127961393,
272.2695042994115
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678112
},
{
"text": "cations such as compressions of the spinal cord or spinal",
"rect": [
65.89285119787439,
250.30523047509126,
285.0486953537186,
260.3052265117695
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678226
},
{
"text": "nerve root can result in irreversible morbidity (4–6). There-",
"rect": [
65.89285119787439,
238.25974422306214,
284.967531476702,
248.25974025974025
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678112
},
{
"text": "fore, fast and accurate diagnosis is necessary for rapid ini-",
"rect": [
65.89285119787439,
226.29546643542002,
285.0000059449828,
236.29546247209822
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678198
},
{
"text": "tiation of optimal therapy and to avoid poor outcome (3).",
"rect": [
65.89285119787439,
214.33118864777802,
283.83116288618606,
224.3311846844561
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678084
},
{
"text": "MRI is the preferred diagnostic imaging modality due",
"rect": [
77.87337365088524,
202.35062160739656,
284.967531476702,
212.35061764407465
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678084
},
{
"text": "to its ability to provide excellent demarcation between",
"rect": [
65.89285119787439,
190.30519480519476,
284.967531476702,
200.30519084187296
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678198
},
{
"text": "intervertebral disk and cerebrospinal fluid (4). However,",
"rect": [
65.89285119787439,
178.3409021550959,
284.967531476702,
188.34091305423095
],
"fontSize": 10.000010899135049
},
{
"text": "there are several potential limitations in clinical routine.",
"rect": [
65.89285119787439,
166.37663922991072,
284.9350718708782,
176.37663526658883
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678112
},
{
"text": "The availability of MRI is usually limited outside of regular",
"rect": [
65.89285119787439,
154.41234657981178,
284.98376127961393,
164.41235747894683
],
"fontSize": 10.000010899135049
},
{
"text": "working hours. There are certain absolute and relative con-",
"rect": [
65.89285119787439,
142.36687519023948,
284.91882720550933,
152.36687122691757
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678084
},
{
"text": "traindications, including cochlear implants, pacemakers,",
"rect": [
65.89285119787439,
130.40259740259737,
284.967531476702,
140.40259343927556
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678198
},
{
"text": "claustrophobia, or the inability to lie still. Furthermore,",
"rect": [
65.89285119787439,
118.43830475249851,
284.98376127961393,
128.43831565163356
],
"fontSize": 10.000010899135049
},
{
"text": "MRI is relatively time-consuming and expensive (7). Thus,",
"rect": [
65.89285119787439,
106.47404182731333,
285.0162357478947,
116.47403786399144
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678112
},
{
"text": "patients with severe back pain often initially undergo CT",
"rect": [
65.89285119787439,
94.4285555752841,
284.98376127961393,
104.42855161196219
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678098
},
{
"text": "instead of MRI (8).",
"rect": [
65.89285119787439,
82.44803312227324,
139.4642867051162,
92.4480440214083
],
"fontSize": 10.000010899135049
},
{
"text": "A large meta-analysis from 2012 (8) showed moderate",
"rect": [
77.87337365088524,
70.48377019708806,
285.0162357478947,
80.48376623376618
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678112
},
{
"text": "sensitivity and specificity of standard CT for the detection",
"rect": [
65.89285119787439,
58.51949240944606,
284.9513016737901,
68.51948844612416
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678098
},
{
"text": "of lumbar disk herniation. More recently, Notohamiprodjo",
"rect": [
65.89285119787439,
46.473991294959866,
284.98376127961393,
56.474002194094915
],
"fontSize": 10.000010899135049
},
{
"text": "et al (9) demonstrated improved results evaluating the di-",
"rect": [
65.89285119787439,
34.50972836977469,
284.98376127961393,
44.50972440645291
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678219
},
{
"text": "agnostic accuracy of single-energy CT compared with MRI",
"rect": [
65.89285119787439,
22.545435719675847,
285.0162357478947,
32.5454466188109
],
"fontSize": 10.000010899135052
},
{
"text": "with application of iterative reconstruction algorithms, al-",
"rect": [
302.58116288618606,
286.1980638380174,
521.6396133621017,
296.1980598746956
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678226
},
{
"text": "though the detection of lumbar disk herniation remained",
"rect": [
302.58116288618606,
274.2337860503754,
521.6233835591898,
284.2337820870536
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678226
},
{
"text": "challenging because of low contrast between intervertebral",
"rect": [
302.58116288618606,
262.2695082627334,
521.6558431650137,
272.2695042994115
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678112
},
{
"text": "disk and cerebrospinal fluid.",
"rect": [
302.58116288618606,
250.30523047509126,
408.8961068685953,
260.3052265117695
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678226
},
{
"text": "Dual-energy CT has opened perspectives in imaging",
"rect": [
314.5617002016538,
238.25974422306214,
521.6883324957513,
248.25974025974025
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678112
},
{
"text": "due to its ability for material characterization (10–14).",
"rect": [
302.58116288618606,
226.29546643542002,
521.6396133621017,
236.29546247209822
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678198
},
{
"text": "In musculoskeletal dual-energy CT, virtual noncalcium",
"rect": [
302.58116288618606,
214.33118864777802,
521.6883176332944,
224.3311846844561
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678084
},
{
"text": "(VNCa) images have been shown to allow for visualiza-",
"rect": [
302.58116288618606,
202.35062160739656,
521.6883176332944,
212.35061764407465
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678084
},
{
"text": "tion of bone marrow edema (15–18). Such color-coded",
"rect": [
302.58116288618606,
190.30519480519476,
521.6396133621017,
200.30519084187296
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678198
},
{
"text": "VNCa reconstructions have also been applied to dual-",
"rect": [
302.58116288618606,
178.3409021550959,
521.6883176332944,
188.34091305423095
],
"fontSize": 10.000010899135049
},
{
"text": "energy CT arthrography (13,19) and improved detec-",
"rect": [
302.58116288618606,
166.37663922991072,
521.6233835591898,
176.37663526658883
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678112
},
{
"text": "tion of bone marrow infiltration in patients with multi-",
"rect": [
302.58116288618606,
154.41234657981178,
521.6883176332944,
164.41235747894683
],
"fontSize": 10.000010899135049
},
{
"text": "ple myeloma (20). With the advent of third-generation,",
"rect": [
302.58116288618606,
142.36687519023948,
521.6233835591898,
152.36687122691757
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678084
},
{
"text": "dual-source,",
"rect": [
302.58116288618606,
130.40259740259737,
350.5519421069653,
140.40259343927556
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678198
},
{
"text": "dual-energy",
