130.40259740259737,
521.3961068685952,
140.40259343927556
],
"fontSize": 9.999996036678198
},
{
"text": "algorithms have been integrated in the postprocessing",
"rect": [
302.58116288618606,
118.43830475249851,
521.6558431650137,
128.43831565163356
],
"fontSize": 10.000010899135049
},
{
"text": "software. Thereby, a novel VNCa postprocessing algo-",
